  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "\u201cHow are you?\u201d \u201cGood \u2026 How are you?\u201d \u201cGreat.\u201d \u201cUm.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 10,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 3.5,
      "duration": 3.5,
      "phoneme_count": 47
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "Yeah.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 1,
      "start_time": 3.5,
      "end_time": 4.775,
      "duration": 1.275,
      "phoneme_count": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "Cool.\u201d \u201cOK, like \u2026 see you.\u201d \u201cYeah.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 4.775,
      "end_time": 7.925,
      "duration": 3.15,
      "phoneme_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "See you.\u201d",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 2,
      "start_time": 7.925,
      "end_time": 9.425,
      "duration": 1.5,
      "phoneme_count": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "Many of us have been tortured by awkward small talk.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 10,
      "start_time": 9.425,
      "end_time": 13.3,
      "duration": 3.875,
      "phoneme_count": 52
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "Are you someone who is good at these brief exchanges, or even enjoys them?",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 13.3,
      "end_time": 18.7,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "phoneme_count": 74
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "Or do you mostly find yourself struggling to think of something \u2014 anything \u2014 to say when trying to make casual conversation?",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 18.7,
      "end_time": 26.975,
      "duration": 8.275,
      "phoneme_count": 128
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "In the Times Opinion guest essay \u201cYou\u2019re Probably Doing Small Talk Wrong,\u201d two behavioral scientists, Maya Rossignac-Milon and Erica Boothby, write that many of the strongest bonds come not from our similarities, but from playful banter:",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 36,
      "start_time": 26.975,
      "end_time": 43.7,
      "duration": 16.725,
      "phoneme_count": 241
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "There\u2019s a moment in human connection that defies easy explanation \u2014 that sudden, electric feeling when you meet someone and feel your minds merge.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 24,
      "start_time": 43.7,
      "end_time": 53.65,
      "duration": 9.95,
      "phoneme_count": 146
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "It happened to the two of us when we met at a psychology symposium: Our small talk during a break quickly gave way to playful theories about coffee drinkers versus tea drinkers.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 32,
      "start_time": 53.65,
      "end_time": 65.85,
      "duration": 12.2,
      "phoneme_count": 179
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "We went to find seats together, unaware that this conversation was the start of a decade-long collaboration and friendship.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 65.85,
      "end_time": 74.15,
      "duration": 8.3,
      "phoneme_count": 126
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Where does that spark come from, exactly?",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 74.15,
      "end_time": 77.2,
      "duration": 3.05,
      "phoneme_count": 43
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "What makes someone feel like a lifelong friend after just a couple of minutes?",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 77.2,
      "end_time": 82.55,
      "duration": 5.35,
      "phoneme_count": 81
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "People tend to assume it\u2019s similarity \u2014 that they are especially likely to hit it off with someone who shares their background or personality traits.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 82.55,
      "end_time": 92.3,
      "duration": 9.75,
      "phoneme_count": 145
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "But in our research, we\u2019ve found that many of the strongest bonds come less from existing similarity and more from riffing playfully.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 92.3,
      "end_time": 101.375,
      "duration": 9.075,
      "phoneme_count": 135
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "In these moments, people create a little world that belongs just to them, a process we call \u201cbuilding a shared reality.\u201d Collaborative riffs are surprisingly central to our mental well-being: They\u2019re the glue that binds us together, adds color to our lives and gives us a sense of purpose.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 49,
      "start_time": 101.375,
      "end_time": 120.575,
      "duration": 19.2,
      "phoneme_count": 289
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "sentence": "And yet our culture\u2019s conversational rituals revolve not around playful co-creation but around exchanging formalities.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 120.575,
      "end_time": 129.7,
      "duration": 9.125,
      "phoneme_count": 125
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "sentence": "Consider the small talk classic: \u201cHow was your weekend?\u201d Convention dictates you keep your answer brief and toss the question back. \u201cGood.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 129.7,
      "end_time": 139.2,
      "duration": 9.5,
      "phoneme_count": 136
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "sentence": "Just binged some Netflix.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 4,
      "start_time": 139.2,
      "end_time": 141.625,
      "duration": 2.425,
      "phoneme_count": 28
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "sentence": "You?\u201d The conversation proceeds predictably. \u201cTook my dog to the park, since it was so nice.\u201d \u201cOh, I have a dog, too.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 141.625,
      "end_time": 149.925,
      "duration": 8.3,
      "phoneme_count": 121
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "sentence": "What kind is yours?\u201d \u201cA lab mix.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 149.925,
      "end_time": 153.1,
      "duration": 3.175,
      "phoneme_count": 36
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "sentence": "He\u2019s 3. \u2026\u201d Both parties walk away with information but still worlds apart.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 153.1,
      "end_time": 158.75,
      "duration": 5.65,
      "phoneme_count": 80
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "sentence": "They may think they\u2019re playing it safe, but that safety traps them in disconnection.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 158.75,
      "end_time": 164.125,
      "duration": 5.375,
      "phoneme_count": 80
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "sentence": "Instead, if these two people strayed from the script and riffed off each other, they might begin to feel that electric buzz of being in sync.",
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "word_count": 26,
      "start_time": 164.125,
      "end_time": 173.075,
      "duration": 8.95,
      "phoneme_count": 135
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "sentence": "It\u2019s like being a kid again: Children skip the boring \u201cgetting to know you\u201d phase and jump straight into pretend play \u2014 transforming into dragon-slaying knights or shipwrecked sailors.",
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "word_count": 29,
      "start_time": 173.075,
      "end_time": 185.3,
      "duration": 12.225,
      "phoneme_count": 178
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "sentence": "\u201cHow was your weekend?\u201d \u201cGood, but I spent way too much time watching people make tiny food on TikTok.\u201d \u201cWhoa, like \u2026 dollhouse-size?\u201d \u201cYes!",
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "word_count": 24,
      "start_time": 185.3,
      "end_time": 195.1,
      "duration": 9.8,
      "phoneme_count": 144
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "sentence": "If you want to learn to make a lasagna in a bottle cap, let me know.\u201d \u201cThat\u2019s hilarious!",
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 195.1,
      "end_time": 201.125,
      "duration": 6.025,
      "phoneme_count": 91
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "sentence": "We could organize a tiny food potluck \u2014 and fit the entire spread on this coaster!\u201d \u201cHa!",
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 201.125,
      "end_time": 207.675,
      "duration": 6.55,
      "phoneme_count": 92
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "sentence": "And we\u2019d need tiny furniture, too.",
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 207.675,
      "end_time": 210.525,
      "duration": 2.85,
      "phoneme_count": 35
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "sentence": "Should we ask that guy over there wearing Carhartt to build it?\u201d",
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "word_count": 12,
      "start_time": 210.525,
      "end_time": 214.625,
      "duration": 4.1,
      "phoneme_count": 61
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "sentence": "Students, read the entire essay and then tell us:",
      "paragraph_id": 10,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 214.625,
      "end_time": 218.425,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "phoneme_count": 50
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "sentence": "Do you enjoy small talk?",
      "paragraph_id": 11,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 218.425,
      "end_time": 220.875,
      "duration": 2.45,
      "phoneme_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "sentence": "Are you good at it?",
      "paragraph_id": 11,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 220.875,
      "end_time": 222.75,
      "duration": 1.875,
      "phoneme_count": 18
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "sentence": "Or do you dread making conversation, finding yourself at a loss for words and stuck in a predictable \u201cscript\u201d?",
      "paragraph_id": 11,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 222.75,
      "end_time": 230.375,
      "duration": 7.625,
      "phoneme_count": 115
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "sentence": "What\u2019s your reaction to the essay?",
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 230.375,
      "end_time": 232.85,
      "duration": 2.475,
      "phoneme_count": 30
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "sentence": "Do you think you have been doing small talk the wrong way?",
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "word_count": 12,
      "start_time": 232.85,
      "end_time": 236.45,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "phoneme_count": 53
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "sentence": "How persuasive is the argument by Ms.",
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 236.45,
      "end_time": 239.575,
      "duration": 3.125,
      "phoneme_count": 39
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "sentence": "Rossignac-Milon and Ms.",
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "word_count": 3,
      "start_time": 239.575,
      "end_time": 242.1,
      "duration": 2.525,
      "phoneme_count": 25
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "sentence": "Boothby that small talk, when done well, is \u201cthe glue that binds us together\u201d?",
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 242.1,
      "end_time": 247.7,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "phoneme_count": 77
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "sentence": "Have you ever had small talk lead to meaningful connection and the \u201celectric buzz of being in sync\u201d?",
      "paragraph_id": 13,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 247.7,
      "end_time": 254.525,
      "duration": 6.825,
      "phoneme_count": 99
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "sentence": "If so, how did you move past the script of boring formulaic exchanges?",
      "paragraph_id": 13,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 254.525,
      "end_time": 259.85,
      "duration": 5.325,
      "phoneme_count": 77
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "sentence": "Do you think you will try more \u201criffing\u201d and \u201cplayful co-creation\u201d in future small talk?",
      "paragraph_id": 14,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 259.85,
      "end_time": 265.525,
      "duration": 5.675,
      "phoneme_count": 87
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "sentence": "On the whole, would you say that you are a good conversationalist?",
      "paragraph_id": 15,
      "word_count": 12,
      "start_time": 265.525,
      "end_time": 269.875,
      "duration": 4.35,
      "phoneme_count": 60
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "sentence": "Are there areas of talk \u2014 and listening \u2014 that you would like to improve?",
      "paragraph_id": 15,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 269.875,
      "end_time": 274.575,
      "duration": 4.7,
      "phoneme_count": 67
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "sentence": "What recent conversation, big or small, have you had that you found especially satisfying?",
      "paragraph_id": 15,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 274.575,
      "end_time": 281.4,
      "duration": 6.825,
      "phoneme_count": 89
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "sentence": "Why?",
      "paragraph_id": 15,
      "word_count": 1,
      "start_time": 281.4,
      "end_time": 282.625,
      "duration": 1.225,
      "phoneme_count": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "sentence": "What advice do you have for others who dread or struggle with making small talk?",
      "paragraph_id": 16,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 282.625,
      "end_time": 287.975,
      "duration": 5.35,
      "phoneme_count": 78
    },
    {
